' Run test: tfdesign renaming a control that has handlers. cmdOK becomes
' cmdSave in the property sheet: its empty GotFocus handler is renamed at
' once, the Click one (with code) after the question (answered Yes);
' cmdOKAY is not cmdOK's. The use in Form_Load (not the ones in a string
' or a comment, nor the form block) is counted in the status line for tfc
' to flag. Not saved: the handlers change in the .bas at once, the form
' block only when saved, so the .bas keeps cmdOK in its block.
Name=tfdesign
Startup=Sub Main
Form=../../designer/window.bas
Module=../../designer/designer.bas
Module=../../designer/model.bas
Module=../../designer/catalog.bas
Module=../../designer/files.bas
